{%- comment -%}
  /llms.txt - a curated, machine-readable map of the store for AI assistants.

  Generated from live store data (products, prices, policies) rather than
  hand-written, so it cannot drift out of date as the catalogue changes.

  Shopify serves this through a page, so the response is text/html rather
  than text/plain; the body is plain text inside a <pre> so it stays
  readable to both crawlers and people.
{%- endcomment -%}
<pre style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;padding:2rem;max-width:60rem;margin:0 auto;direction:ltr;text-align:left;">
# {{ shop.name }}

> {{ shop.description | strip_html }}

Site: {{ shop.url }}
Contact: {{ shop.email }}
Currency: {{ cart.currency.iso_code }}
Ships to: Israel

## What this store sells

Laser-cut wooden wall art. Each piece is cut to order from 6 mm premium MDF
in a matte black finish, and most designs are offered with integrated warm
white LED lighting operated by a mains adapter and a remote (on/off, dimming,
lighting modes). Hidden mounting hooks and all fixings are included.

Sizes: 50x50, 70x70 and 90x90 cm, plus a made-to-measure option up to
120x120 cm. The 50x50 size ships without LED lighting.

