  {{ shop.url }}{{ product.url }}
  {{ product.description | strip_html | truncate: 220 }}
{% endfor %}

## Collections
{% for collection in collections %}{% unless collection.handle == 'all' %}- {{ collection.title }}: {{ shop.url }}{{ collection.url }}
{% endunless %}{% endfor %}

## Policies
{% for policy in shop.policies %}{% if policy != blank %}- {{ policy.title }}: {{ shop.url }}{{ policy.url }}
{% endif %}{% endfor %}

## Ordering and delivery

Made to order. Preparation takes 1-3 business days, delivery a further 1-3
business days within Israel, so 2-6 business days in total. Shipping is free
on orders over 500 ILS; below that it is calculated by weight and destination
at checkout. Returns are accepted within 14 days of delivery, free of charge.

